# Opens A, draws a feature, asks to close while it is unsaved, cancels, saves, closes
# cleanly, opens B, closes it with nothing unsaved, then reopens A and checks the saved
# point is still there. Proves issue #29's acceptance end to end. The editor is started
# with no campaign on the command line:
#
#   cargo run -p campaign --example make_demo -- /tmp/a
#   cargo run -p campaign --example make_demo -- /tmp/b
#   PNP_CONTROL=/tmp/pnp.sock cargo run -p campaign_editor &
#   PNP_CONTROL=/tmp/pnp.sock cargo run -p campaign_editor --bin pnp-ctl -- run \
#       crates/campaign_editor/scenarios/close-and-open.scenario

ping
fixed-delta 0.016

open /tmp/a
step 60
observe world

tool point
click 20 20
close
key escape
observe world

save
close
observe world

open /tmp/b
step 60
observe world
close

open /tmp/a
step 60
observe world
close
observe world
